---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../../data/site.en.json';
import { url } from '../../lib/url';

const m = site.manifesto;
---

<Base
  title="Manifesto"
  description="ROS Guangzhou community manifesto: openness, practice, open-source spirit and long-term commitment."
>
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>Community Manifesto</h1>
    <p>What we believe and how we work.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="padding:1.6rem 1.5rem">
    <p style="font-size:1.12rem;line-height:1.85;margin:0">
      We believe: <strong>{m.belief}</strong>
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>ROS Guangzhou exists so that robotics developers can:</h2>
  <ul class="plain-list">
    {m.goals.map((g) => (<li><div class="title">{g}</div></li>))}
  </ul>

  <h2>We encourage</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    {
      m.values.map((v, i) => (
        <div class="card">
          <span class="meta" style="margin-top:0">0{i + 1}</span>
          <h3 style="margin-top:.35rem">{v.title}</h3>
          <p>{v.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <h2>Build it with us</h2>
  <p style="max-width:62ch">
    A technical community is not a one-off event, but people connecting and growing together over years.
    If these principles resonate with you, join ROS Guangzhou and help build a city community that truly
    belongs to robotics developers.
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top:1.2rem">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href={url('/en/join')}>Join the community</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={url('/en/about')} style="margin-left:.6rem">More about us</a>
  </p>

  <div class="notice" style="margin-top:2rem">
    Adapted from the community introduction <a href={site.source.url} lang="zh-CN">{site.source.title}</a>
    ({site.source.channel}, retrieved {site.source.retrieved}).
    If the community updates the wording, the latest Chinese release prevails.
  </div>
</Base>
